# Modules (the i2c group, ARCHITECTURE #41) reach the header's I2C bus only. The others are the screen's
# DDC/CI (brightness, power: ddcutil runs as root through sudo), the camera's and the HAT EEPROM's.
# := so Pi OS's 99-com.rules (GROUP="i2c") can't hand them back.
SUBSYSTEM=="i2c-dev", KERNEL!="i2c-1", GROUP:="root", MODE:="0600"
